{"_id":"6a2ff4962204ffbc59e5a550","roadmapSlug":"python-data-analysis","nodeId":"XizmE-QroU4GJbjvqNYxe","description":"# Random Module\n\nNumPy's `random` module generates pseudorandom numbers and samples. It provides functions for creating random arrays, sampling from distributions (normal, uniform, binomial), and setting a seed for reproducibility. Random number generation is used in simulation, bootstrapping, and initializing machine learning models.","resources":[{"type":"article","title":"Random Numbers in NumPy","url":"https://www.w3schools.com/python/numpy/numpy_random.asp","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aeae7"},{"type":"article","title":"Numpy Random","url":"https://www.programiz.com/python-programming/numpy/random","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aeae8"},{"type":"video","title":"Random numbers in NumPy are easy! ≡ƒÄ▓","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ql5zGPtxlHY&pp=ygUNIG51bXB5IHJhbmRvbQ%3D%3D","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aeae9"}],"createdAt":"2026-06-15T12:48:22.852Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-07T12:44:22.099Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e3360acf8c05faf5e1c2a","title":"DataCamp - Data Analyst with Python","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/QY0dY9"},{"_id":"6a5e3365acf8c05faf5e1ded","title":"DataCamp - Python Data Fundamentals","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/k4V24x"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/python-data-analysis/content/XizmE-QroU4GJbjvqNYxe.md"}